# Silenttrinity Stager Msbuild Activity | T1127.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/network_connection/net_connection_win_silenttrinity_stager_msbuild_activity.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=3 Image="*\\msbuild.exe" (DestinationPort IN (80, 443)) Initiated="true"
